    <briefdescription>
<para>An instant-based event condition. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Triggers when the propagation reaches a specified instant, using a <ref refid="classostk_1_1astrodynamics_1_1eventcondition_1_1_real_condition" kindref="compound">RealCondition</ref> that compares elapsed seconds since the reference instant. </para>
